{"id":60534,"date":"2026-08-19T11:27:05","date_gmt":"2026-08-19T10:27:05","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-08-19T11:32:08","modified_gmt":"2026-08-19T10:32:08","slug":"night-run-urbano","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/night-run-urbano\/","title":{"rendered":"Night Run Urbano 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO NIGHT RUN 2026 -->\n\n<!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Night Run 2026<\/span>\n  <\/h2>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A Night Run de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos, agendada para 3 de outubro de 2026, oferece um verdadeiro desafio noturno com percursos de 10 km e 6 km. A prova desenrola-se sobre um terreno diversificado que cruza asfalto, cal\u00e7ada, terra batida e escadarias, exigindo constante adapta\u00e7\u00e3o e tra\u00e7\u00e3o apurada. \u00c9 uma corrida urbana sob as estrelas onde a leitura do piso e a gest\u00e3o da inclina\u00e7\u00e3o nas zonas hist\u00f3ricas testam a agilidade no contacto com o solo.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">\/ Snapshot<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong> <span>3 de outubro de 2026<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong> <span>Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos, Leiria<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span>10 km (Trail Urbano) e 6 km (Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria)<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong> <span>Asfalto, cal\u00e7ada, terra batida e escadas<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Prova &#038; Percurso<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    A geometria deste tra\u00e7ado urbano noturno \u00e9 marcada por um dinamismo constante no contacto com o solo. A transi\u00e7\u00e3o r\u00e1pida de asfalto liso para cal\u00e7ada irregular reduz a ader\u00eancia em certas sec\u00e7\u00f5es, exigindo pisadas firmes e precisas sobre este tipo de piso.\n  <\/p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O relevo natural da vila imp\u00f5e subidas curtas e \u00edngremes, complementadas pela inclus\u00e3o de escadarias, o que quebra o ritmo linear e requer mais tra\u00e7\u00e3o. Os tro\u00e7os em terra batida proporcionam um impacto diferente e apelam \u00e0 cautela com o relevo oculto pela escurid\u00e3o.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 4. BANNER DA CALCULADORA DE PACE (CTA INTERATIVO FIXO) -->\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner {\n    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important;\n    border-radius: 16px !important;\n    padding: 18px 22px !important;\n    margin: 24px 0 !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    justify-content: space-between !important;\n    flex-wrap: wrap !important;\n    gap: 14px !important;\n    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-header {\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    gap: 8px !important;\n    margin-bottom: 4px !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-title {\n    color: #FFFFFF !important;\n    font-size: 15px !important;\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc {\n    color: #94A3B8 !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn {\n    display: inline-flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    gap: 8px !important;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important;\n    color: #C4B5FD !important;\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    padding: 10px 20px !important;\n    border-radius: 20px !important;\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n  }\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"pr-calc-event-header\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span>\n      <span class=\"pr-calc-event-title\">Vais correr esta prova com um objetivo de tempo?<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n    <span class=\"pr-calc-event-desc\">Calcula a tua estimativa de tempo final na nossa calculadora ou consulta a tabela de paces.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\">\n    Calculadora de Pace \u2192\n  <\/a>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 5. ONDE FICAR \/ ALOJAMENTO -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Ficar em Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos (Alojamento)<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Para facilitar a desloca\u00e7\u00e3o no dia da prova, recomendamos estas zonas:\n  <\/p>\n  <ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Hotel Rural da Regi\u00e3o:<\/strong> Localizado muito perto da zona central, permitindo acesso r\u00e1pido a p\u00e9 at\u00e9 \u00e0 partida.<\/li>\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Alojamentos Locais na Vila:<\/strong> Ideais para quem procura um ambiente mais tranquilo e necessita de flexibilidade, a uma curta dist\u00e2ncia de carro.<\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 6. GASTRONOMIA E SOBRE O LOCAL -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Gastronomia<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos \u00e9 caracterizado por paisagens fluviais que criam vales acentuados na geografia da vila. Para recuperar no dia seguinte, recomenda-se provar o tradicional Cabrito Assado no forno a lenha, uma iguaria nutritiva e enraizada na cultura local.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 7. SEC\u00c7\u00c3O DE FAQS (DESIGN SYSTEM HOMEPAGE) -->\n<section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Frequentes<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre a Night Run 2026.<\/p>\n\n  <div class=\"pr-faq-grid\">\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o disponibilizados na plataforma de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o, que pode ser acedida na sec\u00e7\u00e3o de links abaixo.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso ver as fotografias do evento?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>As fotografias do evento s\u00e3o geralmente publicadas nas redes sociais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o ou em plataformas especializadas de fotografia desportiva nos dias seguintes \u00e0 prova.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite para concluir a prova?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>O tempo m\u00e1ximo estipulado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o para completar o percurso \u00e9 de 3 horas.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL -->\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":60538,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[38,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-60534","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-figueiro-dos-vinhos-leiria","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-leiria","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_4-solidarias-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/759676792_1368935208755368_9100400685141065371_n-1024x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/60534","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=60534"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/60534\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":60539,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/w